    <div class="fig f2" aria-hidden="true"><span class="tag"><span>Your voice</span><time>13:58</time></span><canvas data-draw="voice"></canvas></div>
    <div class="fig f5" aria-hidden="true"><span class="tag"><span>6 clicks</span><time>14:01</time></span><canvas data-draw="clicks"></canvas></div>
    <div class="fig f6 r" aria-hidden="true"><span class="tag"><span>Key masked</span><time>14:02</time></span><canvas data-draw="mask"></canvas></div>
    <div class="fig f4 r" aria-hidden="true"><span class="tag"><span>Drafting</span><time>14:04</time></span><canvas data-draw="ribbon"></canvas></div>
    <div class="fig f3 r" aria-hidden="true"><span class="tag"><span>Note ready</span><time>14:05</time></span><canvas data-draw="note"></canvas></div>

    <div class="hero-copy">
      <span class="stage"><img src={glyphLight.src} alt="" width="16" height="16" />In development</span>
      <h1 id="h-hero">Fix the problem. <span>The note is already written.</span></h1>
      <p class="sub">ScreenTrail follows a technician's remote session on their PC, masks the passwords and keys it reads on screen before anything is stored, and has the note, the time entry and the KB article drafted when the session ends.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn-dark" href="#pilot">Become a pilot MSP</a>
        <a class="btn btn-line" href="#how">See how it works</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-figs" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="fig"><span class="tag"><span>Drafting</span><time>14:04</time></span><canvas data-draw="ribbon"></canvas></div>
      <div class="fig r"><span class="tag"><span>Note ready</span><time>14:05</time></span><canvas data-draw="note"></canvas></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="scene" id="scene" data-pill="rec" aria-labelledby="h-scene">
    <div class="scene-pin">
      <div class="wrap scene-copy">
        <div class="cap on" data-cap="0"><h2 id="h-scene">Remote sessions end. The notes don't get written.</h2><p class="sub">A technician can work dozens of remote sessions a week. Notes get typed from memory at the end of the day, or not at all.</p></div>
        <div class="cap" data-cap="1"><p class="h2-like"><strong>With ScreenTrail, every session gets its note.</strong></p><p class="sub">Each draft is built from what was on screen and what the technician said, ready when the session ends.</p></div>
        <div class="cap" data-cap="2"><p class="h2-like"><strong>Each one is a real ticket note.</strong></p><p class="sub">Problem, steps and result, each step beside the screenshot it happened on.</p></div>
        <div class="cap" data-cap="3"><p class="h2-like"><strong>Checked by a person, published in one press.</strong></p><p class="sub">The note and time entry go to ConnectWise, the article to Hudu.</p></div>
        <p class="tally" aria-hidden="true">Notes written this week <b id="tally">38</b> <span>of 46</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="scene-stage" id="stage" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="wall" id="wall">
          <div class="hours"><span>08</span><span>10</span><span>12</span><span>14</span><span>16</span></div>
          {days.map((d) => (
            <div class="day">
              <span class="dh">{d.name}</span>
              <div class="col">
                {d.tiles.map((t) => (
                  <div class={`tile${t.bad ? ' bad' : ''}${t.last ? ' this' : ''}`} data-day={d.name} data-time={t.time} data-start={t.start} data-dur={t.dur}>
                    <span class="a">{t.bad ? (<><span class="row"><span class="k">{t.bad[0]}</span><span>{t.time}</span></span><b>{t.bad[1]}</b></>) : (<><span>{t.time}</span><span>{t.id}</span></>)}</span>
                    <span class="b"><span class="st"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M2 6.5l2.5 2.5L10 3.5"/></svg><span class="tp">{t.topic}</span></span><span class="lg">{t.logged}</span></span>
                  </div>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
          <div class="playhead" id="playhead"><span id="ph-label">08:00</span></div>
        </div>
        <article class="scene-note" id="scene-note">
          <div class="sn-head"><span class="chip"><b>#48213</b> Printer offline · Acme Dental</span><span class="chip on">Internal note</span><span class="chip">Time <b>15</b> min</span></div>
          <div class="sn-body note">
            <h3>Problem</h3>
            <div class="ln"><span></span><span>Nothing would print from the reception workstation; jobs sat in the queue.</span><span></span></div>
            <h3>Steps</h3>
            <!-- Each step beside the screenshot it happened on, at its time in the session (13:54 to 14:05);
                 step 2's password is painted over, as it was on screen. Drawn, not photographed. -->
            <div class="ln st"><span>1.</span><span>Found the Print Spooler service stopped.</span><figure class="sshot"><svg class="shot-svg" viewBox="0 0 160 90" aria-hidden="true"><rect class="w-frame" x=".5" y=".5" width="159" height="89" rx="4"/><path class="w-bar" d="M1 4.5a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h150a4 4 0 0 1 4 4V13H1z"/><text class="w-title" x="7" y="9.5">Services</text><path class="w-ctl" d="M136 7h5M145 5h4v4h-4zM153 5l4 4M157 5l-4 4"/><text class="w-head" x="8" y="23">Name</text><text class="w-head" x="104" y="23">Status</text><path class="w-rule" d="M6 26h148"/>
<text class="w-t" x="8" y="36">Plug and Play</text><text class="w-mute" x="104" y="36">Running</text>
<rect class="w-badrow" x="4" y="40" width="152" height="13" rx="2"/><text class="w-bad b" x="8" y="49">Print Spooler</text><text class="w-bad" x="104" y="49">Stopped</text>
<text class="w-t" x="8" y="62">Remote Registry</text><text class="w-mute" x="104" y="62">Manual</text>
<text class="w-t" x="8" y="74">Windows Update</text><text class="w-mute" x="104" y="74">Running</text>
<path class="w-cursor" d="M92 47l0 11 3-3 2 5 2-1-2-5h4z"/></svg><figcaption>13:57</figcaption></figure></div>
            <div class="ln st"><span>2.</span><span>Started the service and set it to restart automatically on failure.</span><figure class="sshot"><svg class="shot-svg" viewBox="0 0 160 90" aria-hidden="true"><rect class="w-frame" x=".5" y=".5" width="159" height="89" rx="4"/><path class="w-bar" d="M1 4.5a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h150a4 4 0 0 1 4 4V13H1z"/><text class="w-title" x="7" y="9.5">Print Spooler Properties</text><path class="w-ctl" d="M136 7h5M145 5h4v4h-4zM153 5l4 4M157 5l-4 4"/><text class="w-tab on" x="8" y="23">General</text><text class="w-tab" x="40" y="23">Log On</text><text class="w-tab" x="70" y="23">Recovery</text><path class="w-rule" d="M6 26h148"/>
<text class="w-t" x="8" y="38">Startup type</text><rect class="w-field" x="62" y="31" width="90" height="10" rx="2"/><text class="w-t" x="66" y="38.5">Automatic</text><path class="w-ctl" d="M144 35l2 2 2-2"/>
<text class="w-t" x="8" y="52">Log on as</text><rect class="w-field" x="62" y="45" width="90" height="10" rx="2"/><rect class="w-mask" x="64" y="47" width="64" height="6" rx="1"/><text class="w-masktext" x="131" y="52">masked</text>
<text class="w-t" x="8" y="66">On failure</text><rect class="w-field" x="62" y="59" width="90" height="10" rx="2"/><text class="w-t" x="66" y="66.5">Restart the service</text>
<rect class="w-btn" x="118" y="74" width="34" height="11" rx="2"/><text class="w-btntext" x="135" y="81.5" text-anchor="middle">Start</text></svg><figcaption>14:02 · masked</figcaption></figure></div>
            <div class="ln st"><span>3.</span><span>Cleared the stuck queue and printed a test page.</span><figure class="sshot"><svg class="shot-svg" viewBox="0 0 160 90" aria-hidden="true"><rect class="w-frame" x=".5" y=".5" width="159" height="89" rx="4"/><path class="w-bar" d="M1 4.5a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h150a4 4 0 0 1 4 4V13H1z"/><text class="w-title" x="7" y="9.5">Reception printer</text><path class="w-ctl" d="M136 7h5M145 5h4v4h-4zM153 5l4 4M157 5l-4 4"/><text class="w-head" x="8" y="23">Document</text><text class="w-head" x="104" y="23">Status</text><path class="w-rule" d="M6 26h148"/>
<text class="w-mute" x="8" y="38">Queue cleared, 0 documents</text>
<path class="w-ghost" d="M8 46h96M8 55h80M8 64h88"/>
<rect class="w-toast" x="62" y="68" width="92" height="16" rx="3"/><path class="w-okmark" d="M68 76l2.5 2.5L75 73.5"/><text class="w-toasttext" x="79" y="79">Test page printed</text></svg><figcaption>14:04</figcaption></figure></div>
            <h3>Result</h3>
            <div class="ln"><span></span><span>Printing works again from the reception PC.</span><span></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="sn-stamp"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7"/></svg>Published to ticket #48213 · note, time entry, KB article</div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="wall-note">An illustration of a week of sessions, not measured data.</p>
