  </section>

  <section class="session wrap" data-pill="rec" id="session" aria-labelledby="h-session">
    <div class="session-pin" id="session-pin">
    <h2 id="h-session">One session, start to ticket.</h2>
    <p class="sub mt">Ten minutes on a stuck print queue at Acme Dental. Everything ScreenTrail keeps is tied to the moment it happened, and threads through to the note.</p>
    <div class="events-box" id="events">
    <svg class="ribbon" id="ribbon" aria-hidden="true"></svg>
    <ol class="events">
      <li class="ev"><span class="knot"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="4" fill="#FF6B6B"/></svg>13:54</span><h3>Recording starts</h3><p>The ScreenConnect window comes forward, and its title is matched to ticket #48213.</p></li>
      <li class="ev"><span class="knot"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5.5" y="1.5" width="5" height="8" rx="2.5"/><path d="M3 8a5 5 0 0 0 10 0M8 13v2"/></svg>13:58</span><h3>You talk it through</h3><p><q>Nothing will print from reception.</q> Transcribed on the PC.</p></li>
      <li class="ev"><span class="knot"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 2l9 5-4 1.2L6.5 13z"/></svg>14:01</span><h3>Clicks are logged</h3><p>Services, then Print Spooler: each click with the window it landed in.</p></li>
      <li class="ev"><span class="knot"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1.5" y="3" width="13" height="10" rx="2"/><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="2.3"/></svg>14:02</span><h3>A frame is kept</h3><p>The screen showing the stopped service, masked, becomes screenshot 1.</p></li>
      <li class="ev"><span class="knot"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.5 14.5V2M3.5 2h8l-1.6 3 1.6 3h-8"/></svg>14:03</span><h3>You mark a moment</h3><p><kbd>Ctrl+Alt+M</kbd> flags the restart-on-failure change as worth a step.</p></li>
      <li class="ev"><span class="knot"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="4" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5" fill="currentColor"/></svg>14:04</span><h3>Stop and draft</h3><p><kbd>Ctrl+Alt+S</kbd> ends it after ten minutes. The draft, with Problem, Steps, Result and Follow-ups, is waiting.</p></li>
      <li class="ev"><span class="knot"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 8.5l3.5 3.5 7.5-8"/></svg>14:20</span><h3>You check it</h3><p>Three steps confirmed, the one flagged step looked at, the time rounded up to 15 minutes.</p></li>
      <li class="ev end"><span class="knot"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1.5 7.5l13-5.5-4 12-3-4.5zM7.5 9.5l7-7.5"/></svg>14:24</span><h3>Published</h3><p>Note and time entry in ConnectWise, the KB article in Hudu. Only because you chose to.</p></li>
    </ol>
    </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="stages wrap" id="how" aria-labelledby="h-how">
    <h2 id="h-how">How it works, stage by stage.</h2>

    <article class="feature" data-pill="rec" aria-labelledby="h-f1">
      <div class="copy">
        <span class="stage-tag" data-s="rec" aria-hidden="true"><i></i>Recording<time>13:54</time></span>
        <h3 id="h-f1">Capture starts with the remote tool.</h3>
        <p>Bring a ScreenConnect or Remote Desktop window to the front and the pill appears. Every click, every screen change and every spoken line goes onto one timeline. Switch to email and the screenshots stop until the remote tool is back in front.</p>
        <dl class="points">
          <div><dt>Keys</dt><dd><kbd>Ctrl+Alt+P</kbd> pause, <kbd>Ctrl+Alt+S</kbd> stop and draft, <kbd>Ctrl+Alt+M</kbd> mark a moment</dd></div>
          <div><dt>By hand</dt><dd><kbd>Ctrl+Alt+R</kbd> or Start capture in the tray, when a session didn't start on its own</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Scope</dt><dd>The remote tool's windows only, plus admin tools if you allow them</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Voice</dt><dd>The technician's microphone, transcribed on the PC</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
      <div class="mock-stage">
      <div class="mock" data-replay aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="mock-bar"><span>session · ScreenConnect · #48213</span><span class="pill"><i class="dot"></i>Recording <span class="tm" data-clock>02:17</span></span></div>
        <ol class="mock-body tl">
          <li class="tl-row i0"><time>14:01:58</time><span class="kind click">click</span><span class="what">Start · Services</span></li>
          <li class="tl-row i1"><time>14:02:06</time><span class="kind frame">frame</span><span class="what">Screen changed · screenshot 1</span></li>
          <li class="tl-row i2"><time>14:02:11</time><span class="kind said">said</span><span class="what"><q>Spooler service is stopped, that's why nothing is printing.</q></span></li>
          <li class="tl-row i3"><time>14:02:40</time><span class="kind click">click</span><span class="what">Print Spooler · Restart</span></li>
          <li class="tl-row i4"><time>14:03:02</time><span class="kind said">said</span><span class="what"><q>Started it again and set it to restart on failure.</q></span></li>
          <li class="tl-row i5"><time>14:03:03</time><span class="kind mark">mark</span><span class="what">Moment marked · screenshot 2</span></li>
          <li class="tl-row i6"><time>14:04:15</time><span class="kind frame">frame</span><span class="what">Test page printed · screenshot 3</span></li>
        </ol>
        <div class="progress"><i class="on"></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
      </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="feature" data-pill="paused" aria-labelledby="h-f2">
      <div class="copy">
        <span class="stage-tag" data-s="paused" aria-hidden="true"><i></i>Paused<time>14:02</time></span>
        <h3 id="h-f2">Secrets are masked before anything is kept.</h3>
        <p>When a password field has focus, capture pauses and the pill says so. Every screenshot is read on the PC, and the passwords, card numbers and keys it finds are painted out before the frame is stored or sent.</p>
        <dl class="points">
          <div><dt>Where</dt><dd>On the technician's PC, before storage and before sending</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Check</dt><dd>The draft says how many items were masked, so they can be checked</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Exclude</dt><dd>Apps on the exclusion list are not captured at all</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
      <div class="mock-stage">
      <div class="mock" data-replay aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="mock-bar"><span>screenshot 2 · before it is stored</span><span class="pill"><i class="pz"></i>Paused: sensitive field</span></div>
        <div class="mock-body">
          <div class="remote">
            <div class="rt"><span>Remote session · RECEPTION-PC</span><span>notepad · printer-setup.txt</span></div>
            <div class="ln">Printer: HP LaserJet M404 · queue: Reception</div>
            <div class="ln">Wi-Fi key: <span class="secret i0">Gr33nT3a-Lobby!26</span></div>
            <div class="ln">Portal login: admin / <span class="secret i1">Spr1ng-Board-7731</span></div>
            <div class="ln">Driver: v5.2.1 · reinstall if the queue jams</div>
            <div class="field"><span>Admin password</span><span>capture paused while this has focus</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="redact-foot">
            <span class="badge iris"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><rect x="2" y="5" width="12" height="6" rx="1"/></svg>2 items masked, none left to review</span>
            <span class="small-cap">Sample text. The masks are painted into the stored image.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="progress"><i class="on"></i><i class="on"></i><i></i><i></i></div>
      </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="feature" data-pill="drafting" aria-labelledby="h-f3">
      <div class="copy">
        <span class="stage-tag" data-s="drafting" aria-hidden="true"><i></i>Drafting<time>14:04</time></span>
        <h3 id="h-f3">A draft to read, not a blank box to fill.</h3>
        <p>When the session stops, the note is waiting: Problem, Steps, Result and Follow-ups, each step beside the screenshot it happened on. The ticket is picked from the remote window's title and the time entry is filled in. A step drawn only from the screen, with nothing said about it, is marked for a second look.</p>
        <dl class="points">
          <div><dt>Edit</dt><dd>Click any line to change it; reorder steps from the keyboard</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Choose</dt><dd>Internal note, or a discussion the customer sees</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Adapt</dt><dd>Picks up a few habits from your edits, such as past tense or shorter steps</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
      <div class="mock-stage">
      <div class="mock" data-replay aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="mock-bar"><span>review · draft</span><span>3 steps · 3 screenshots</span></div>
        <div class="mock-body note">
          <div class="note-head">
            <span class="chip"><b>#48213</b> Printer offline · Acme Dental</span>
            <span class="chip on">Internal note</span>
            <span class="chip">Time <b>15</b> min</span>
          </div>
