<text class="w-t" x="8" y="36">Plug and Play</text><text class="w-mute" x="104" y="36">Running</text>
<rect class="w-badrow" x="4" y="40" width="152" height="13" rx="2"/><text class="w-bad b" x="8" y="49">Print Spooler</text><text class="w-bad" x="104" y="49">Stopped</text>
<text class="w-t" x="8" y="62">Remote Registry</text><text class="w-mute" x="104" y="62">Manual</text>
<text class="w-t" x="8" y="74">Windows Update</text><text class="w-mute" x="104" y="74">Running</text>
<path class="w-cursor" d="M92 47l0 11 3-3 2 5 2-1-2-5h4z"/></svg></span></div>
          <div class="ln flag i4"><span>2.</span><span>Started the service and set it to restart automatically on failure. <span class="badge warn sm">Inferred from screen only</span></span><span class="shot"><svg class="shot-svg mini" viewBox="0 0 160 90" aria-hidden="true"><rect class="w-frame" x=".5" y=".5" width="159" height="89" rx="4"/><path class="w-bar" d="M1 4.5a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h150a4 4 0 0 1 4 4V13H1z"/><text class="w-title" x="7" y="9.5">Print Spooler Properties</text><path class="w-ctl" d="M136 7h5M145 5h4v4h-4zM153 5l4 4M157 5l-4 4"/><text class="w-tab on" x="8" y="23">General</text><text class="w-tab" x="40" y="23">Log On</text><text class="w-tab" x="70" y="23">Recovery</text><path class="w-rule" d="M6 26h148"/>
<text class="w-t" x="8" y="38">Startup type</text><rect class="w-field" x="62" y="31" width="90" height="10" rx="2"/><text class="w-t" x="66" y="38.5">Automatic</text><path class="w-ctl" d="M144 35l2 2 2-2"/>
<text class="w-t" x="8" y="52">Log on as</text><rect class="w-field" x="62" y="45" width="90" height="10" rx="2"/><rect class="w-mask" x="64" y="47" width="64" height="6" rx="1"/><text class="w-masktext" x="131" y="52">masked</text>
<text class="w-t" x="8" y="66">On failure</text><rect class="w-field" x="62" y="59" width="90" height="10" rx="2"/><text class="w-t" x="66" y="66.5">Restart the service</text>
<rect class="w-btn" x="118" y="74" width="34" height="11" rx="2"/><text class="w-btntext" x="135" y="81.5" text-anchor="middle">Start</text></svg></span></div>
          <div class="ln i5"><span>3.</span><span>Cleared the stuck queue and printed a test page.</span><span class="shot"><svg class="shot-svg mini" viewBox="0 0 160 90" aria-hidden="true"><rect class="w-frame" x=".5" y=".5" width="159" height="89" rx="4"/><path class="w-bar" d="M1 4.5a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h150a4 4 0 0 1 4 4V13H1z"/><text class="w-title" x="7" y="9.5">Reception printer</text><path class="w-ctl" d="M136 7h5M145 5h4v4h-4zM153 5l4 4M157 5l-4 4"/><text class="w-head" x="8" y="23">Document</text><text class="w-head" x="104" y="23">Status</text><path class="w-rule" d="M6 26h148"/>
