    <article class="feature" data-pill="published" aria-labelledby="h-f4">
      <div class="copy">
        <span class="stage-tag" data-s="published" aria-hidden="true"><i></i>Published<time>14:24</time></span>
        <h3 id="h-f4">One press, and it lands where it belongs.</h3>
        <p>Publish sends the note and the time entry to the ConnectWise ticket, and the article to Hudu as a draft under the right company. The receipt says what landed, with a link to each.</p>
        <dl class="points">
          <div><dt>Person</dt><dd>Nothing is published until a technician presses Publish</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Unsure</dt><dd>A send whose answer was lost is held as "Not confirmed" until you check the ticket, so it isn't sent again by accident</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Offline</dt><dd>A session recorded offline is drafted once the connection is back</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
      <div class="mock-stage">
